# M2's platform services on the page: the system turns light while the page shows System (Arctic
# Ice on a dark system), and the page and the theme chip's label follow it to Clean Teal; then
# reduced motion comes on, which nothing at rest shows. The page waits 2 s first, as M6's states
# do, so React's plane has finished its first paint.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode system
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
scheme light
wait 32
shot light
reduced-motion on
wait 32
shot reduced
